{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:25 2026-11-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:25 2026-11-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:25 2026-11-01 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0e7264cce16afd911e3ae7f545c3f44/2026-11/2026-10-31_23_17_23_0.png\"/><p>將軍澳發生縱火案。今日（11月1日）凌晨1時12分，有途人發現停泊在寶寧路25號公共單車泊位的數輛單車起火，遂報案求助。</p><p>消防員接報到場，將火救熄。經初步調查，現場共有9輛單車被燒毀，消防相信起火原因有可疑。</p><p>警方將案件列作「縱火」跟進，暫未有人被捕。事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.822003+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T23:25:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:03.896538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:03.896538+00:00","content_hash":"83326708c9f8c901eafc8b656005dde307f1df752a6dbd9038d708da5bcc588c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}